OL,3,GNEWSABody of newborn baby found on
OL,4,Ashoreline in Wales as police search for
OL,5,Amother
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring a press conference, director of
OL,8,Fmidwifery and women's services for
OL,9,FBetsi Cadwaladr University Health Board
OL,10,FFiona Giraud has appealed directly to
OL,11,Fthe mother to come forward.
